    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d236">

                <pb facs="0504" n="484" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg484"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-01-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 15, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: Referring-to your communication of the
                    17th ultimo relative to <pb facs="0505" n="485" xml:id="pg485"/> the case of
                    Patrick Hamilton—a prisoner in Fort Warren—and to my reply, I have the honor to
                    enclose herewith the copy of a letter of the 7 th instant, addressed to this
                    department by the Secretary of the Navy.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, your lordship’s obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD,</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d236-a1.xml" xpointer="d236-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
